From 0d7db4b7dacac2855b69161cb039b855689acea4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Imogen <imogenono@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 23:02:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Wallet: Make an Offer on recipient's gifts from Send Money
 sheet

Adds a 'Make an Offer' item to the Send Money menu when the recipient
shows collectible gifts that accept offers. Picking a gift reuses the
amount keypad to name a GRAM price and sends it through the existing
payments.sendStarGiftOffer method. Offer service bubbles get a status
ribbon (offer / sold / declined / expired).
